  <section xml:id="sec-inst-statements">
    <title>Institutional Syllabus Statements</title>
    <p>
      <b>Accommodations, Conflicts, and Rescheduled Exams.</b> The only assignments that may be rescheduled are exams. Except in the case of severe illness or emergency, I need advance notice so that we can arrange a make-up midterm for you. Give me notice at least one week prior to the exam that you have an academic accommodation or a conflict due to academics, a religious observance, work, athletics, or a student organization event. The final exam is scheduled by the registrar and can be rescheduled only in very specific circumstances: travel plans home for break don’t count, but three finals on the same day do.
    </p>
